# Mutation plan for the plugin API's file, dialog, mail and inter-plugin HTTP methods
# (docs/PLUGIN_PLAN.md, Phase 6).
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/plugin-api-files.plan
#
# The oracle is `parity::plugin_hooks::the_plugin_api_file_methods_answer_as_go_answers`: 72
# calls from inside ExecuteCommand on a Go host and a Rust host, every answer, every hook, every
# frame, the FileInfo rows and every stored byte. One line is a unit mutation: a status written
# after the head was handed over cannot reach any answer. The last two lines are the no-op
# controls and must SURVIVE.

